OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers arrested over fire at
OL,4,Abuilding
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys have been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with a large fire that has
OL,8,Fclosed roads in a town centre.
OL,10,FNorthumberland Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fwas called to Fenkle Street in Alnwick
OL,12,Fat 21:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FCrews from five appliances worked
OL,15,Fthroughout the night to make sure the
OL,16,Fblaze did not spread to any adjoining
OL,17,Fbuildings.
OL,19,FFirefighters were at the scene earlier
OL,20,Fto damp down hotspots, and drivers have
OL,21,Fbeen warned disruption is likely to
OL,22,Fcontinue throughout the day.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
